{"meta":{"description":"## Who's it for\nAgencies, freelancers and sales teams who have a list of company websites and need contact details to reach them: emails, phone numbers and social profiles.\n\n## How it works\n1. Reads company websites from a Google Sheet (column `website`, `url` or `domain`).\n2. Removes duplicates and sends all websites to the **Contact Details Scraper** on Apify in a single run.\n3. The scraper visits each homepage plus its contact and about pages, decodes protected emails, validates phone numbers and checks that each email's domain can receive mail.\n4. Writes one clean row per company to a results sheet: best email, all emails, phone, Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, X, YouTube, contact page and email provider.\n\n## How to set up\n1. Create a free Apify account and connect it in the **Find contacts** node (API token from Apify Console → Settings → API & Integrations).\n2. Connect Google Sheets, pick your input sheet in **Read websites** and an empty results sheet in **Append contacts**.\n3. Optionally adjust **Settings** (pages per website, spend cap).\n\n## Requirements\n- Apify account. You pay only for websites where an email or phone is found (about $3 per 1,000).\n- Google Sheets account.\n- Uses the verified Apify community node. Self-hosted users can install `@apify/n8n-nodes-apify`.\n\n## How to customize the workflow\nSwap Google Sheets for Airtable, HubSpot or a CSV. Add a filter after **Flatten for spreadsheet** to keep only rows with an email.","templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"Enrich company websites from Google Sheets with emails and phone numbers using Apify","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"0b75a944-7f13-470c-96a6-a5bcb59d7006","name":"Note 167cce","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-660,-300],"parameters":{"color":1,"width":560,"height":1000,"content":"# Enrich company websites from Google Sheets with emails and phone numbers using Apify\n\n## Who's it for\nAgencies, freelancers and sales teams who have a list of company websites and need contact details to reach them: emails, phone numbers and social profiles.\n\n## How it works\n1. Reads company websites from a Google Sheet (column `website`, `url` or `domain`).\n2. Removes duplicates and sends all websites to the **Contact Details Scraper** on Apify in a single run.\n3. The scraper visits each homepage plus its contact and about pages, decodes protected emails, validates phone numbers and checks that each email's domain can receive mail.\n4. Writes one clean row per company to a results sheet: best email, all emails, phone, Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, X, YouTube, contact page and email provider.\n\n## How to set up\n1. Create a free Apify account and connect it in the **Find contacts** node (API token from Apify Console → Settings → API & Integrations).\n2. Connect Google Sheets, pick your input sheet in **Read websites** and an empty results sheet in **Append contacts**.\n3. Optionally adjust **Settings** (pages per website, spend cap).\n\n## Requirements\n- Apify account. You pay only for websites where an email or phone is found (about $3 per 1,000).\n- Google Sheets account.\n- Uses the verified Apify community node. Self-hosted users can install `@apify/n8n-nodes-apify`.\n\n## How to customize the workflow\nSwap Google Sheets for Airtable, HubSpot or a CSV. Add a filter after **Flatten for spreadsheet** to keep only rows with an email."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"c651e95c-2d24-48fb-ac7d-01f942dae22d","name":"Note 6b16f2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-20,-60],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":660,"height":180,"content":"### 1. Input\nRun manually, then read your websites from Google Sheets. Set pages per website and the spend cap in **Settings**."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d9124555-d6a4-4538-8a6d-0dd499361871","name":"Note 7af13c","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[680,-60],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":440,"height":180,"content":"### 2. Find contacts\nAll unique websites go to the Contact Details Scraper in **one** Apify run. You pay only for websites where an email or phone is found."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"31d0e2cf-260a-46ab-b08b-53662cd84842","name":"Note 122cf9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1160,-60],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":440,"height":180,"content":"### 3. Save\nOne clean row per company: email, phone, socials, contact page, email provider."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"7fb685da-e681-4482-9701-63fde4131e20","name":"When clicking ‘Test workflow’","type":"n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger","position":[0,160],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f8d88e26-962e-4e16-ba09-1e39c93e65ab","name":"Settings","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[220,160],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"0f3d6537-f5cf-423e-bfba-a925469076b4","name":"maxPagesPerWebsite","type":"number","value":5},{"id":"56a44eb3-5103-4ec6-b117-80811c7acb43","name":"maxCostUsd","type":"number","value":5}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"fe441ece-1376-4977-a659-91e223e57a76","name":"Read websites","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[440,160],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":""},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":""}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"120b90c6-57e9-44de-98f5-7ba191b8f77f","name":"Collect unique websites","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[700,160],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Collect unique websites from the incoming rows (a sheet column or Google Maps results)\n// and send them to the Contact Details Scraper in ONE run (cheaper and faster than one run per row).\nconst FIELDS = ['website', 'Website', 'WEBSITE', 'url', 'URL', 'Url', 'domain', 'Domain', 'DOMAIN'];\n\nfunction hostOf(value) {\n  let v = String(value || '').trim();\n  if (!v) return null;\n  if (v.includes('@') && !v.includes('://')) v = v.split('@').pop();\n  if (!/^https?:\\/\\//i.test(v)) v = 'https://' + v;\n  try {\n    const host = new URL(v).hostname.toLowerCase().replace(/^www\\./, '');\n    return host.includes('.') ? host : null;\n  } catch (e) {\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst websites = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const row = item.json || {};\n  const raw = FIELDS.map((f) => row[f]).find((v) => v);\n  const host = hostOf(raw);\n  if (host && !seen.has(host)) {\n    seen.add(host);\n    websites.push(host);\n  }\n}\n\nif (websites.length === 0) {\n  throw new Error('No websites found. Make sure your rows have a \"website\", \"url\" or \"domain\" column.');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { websites, count: websites.length } }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"275a4297-5dc1-4b95-8965-df971ac11bed","name":"Find contacts (Contact Details Scraper)","type":"@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify","notes":"Pay only for websites with an email or phone","position":[920,160],"parameters":{"memory":1024,"actorId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"jipdiW9Rwbp1Lruzx"},"resource":"Actors","operation":"Run actor and get dataset","customBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ websites: $json.websites, maxPagesPerWebsite: $('Settings').first().json.maxPagesPerWebsite }) }}","maxTotalChargeUsd":"={{ $('Settings').first().json.maxCostUsd }}"},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":2},{"id":"7be4cf6d-fed0-44be-b37a-0e6741b8108d","name":"Flatten for spreadsheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1200,160],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Turn Contact Details Scraper results into simple spreadsheet rows (one row per website).\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const r = item.json || {};\n  return {\n    json: {\n      website: r.domain || '',\n      company: r.companyName || '',\n      email: r.primaryEmail || '',\n      all_emails: r.allEmails || '',\n      phone: r.primaryPhone || '',\n      all_phones: r.allPhones || '',\n      facebook: r.facebook || '',\n      instagram: r.instagram || '',\n      linkedin: r.linkedin || '',\n      x_twitter: r.x || '',\n      youtube: r.youtube || '',\n      contact_page: r.contactPageUrl || '',\n      contact_form: r.contactFormUrl || '',\n      email_provider: r.mailboxProvider || '',\n      status: r.status || '',\n    },\n  };\n});\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e827ac00-51fb-4945-b518-478ab407382e","name":"Append contacts","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1420,160],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":""},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":""}},"typeVersion":4.5}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"Settings":{"main":[[{"node":"Read websites","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read websites":{"main":[[{"node":"Collect unique websites","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Collect unique websites":{"main":[[{"node":"Find contacts (Contact Details Scraper)","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Flatten for spreadsheet":{"main":[[{"node":"Append contacts","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When clicking ‘Test workflow’":{"main":[[{"node":"Settings","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Find contacts (Contact Details Scraper)":{"main":[[{"node":"Flatten for spreadsheet","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}